      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="intro">Your personal photos and identity belong to you. This policy outlines what data StatusGrid accesses, why specific Android device permissions are required, and our strict zero-data-selling guarantee.</p>
      <p class="meta">Effective date: 13 November 2026 &bull; App: StatusGrid &bull; Package: <code>in.statusgrid.app</code> &bull; Web: <code>statusgrid.pages.dev</code></p>
